OL,3,GNEWSAPulp's star plaque honours
OL,4,Alegendary city band
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheffield indie-rockers Pulp have been
OL,7,Fofficially honoured as legends of their
OL,8,Fhome city with the unveiling of a walk
OL,9,Fof fame star plaque outside the town
OL,10,Fhall.
OL,12,FPast and present members of the band,
OL,13,Fincluding singer Jarvis Cocker,
OL,14,Fgathered for the celebration and held a
OL,15,Fpop-up event at a nearby pub.
OL,17,FThey join Gordon Banks, Dame Jessica
OL,18,FEnnis, Michael Palin and others in
OL,19,Freceiving the accolade, which was
OL,20,Funveiled by the band and the Lord Mayor
OL,21,Fof Sheffield.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
