OL,3,GNEWSAPulp's star plaque honours
OL,4,Alegendary city band
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to a crowd watching the
OL,7,Fceremony, Cocker said: "It's nice to
OL,8,Fget a legend star and I'll walk past it
OL,9,Fat some point, I'm sure, but the thing
OL,10,Fthat's great about being in a band is
OL,11,Finventing things and making up stuff
OL,12,Ffor yourself."
